    <string name="demo_ar_measure_description">Measure a real space the way a tradesperson does. Distance chains points on any surface and closes shapes for their area. Wall takes the two ends of a wall on the floor, then raises it to your aim; Door or window then takes each opening off its area. Room traces the floor corner by corner, then raises every wall to the ceiling: floor area, perimeter, wall area and volume; Door or window takes each opening off the walls, and Plan draws the room to scale with its PDF. Share sends the numbers as text.</string>
